title: Blue in Green
key: Dm
tempo: 66
style: jazz

// Ten bars, slow, and it goes round without a seam: it opens on the four of
// D minor, not the one, and its last two bars are the way back there. The
// tonic comes in bar three and again in bar seven and moves on each time:
// down a half step into a two-five to B-flat, then by its five to A minor.
[A]
| Gm6       | A7#9 | Dm7 Db7 | Cm7 F7 |
| Bbmaj7#11 | A7#9 | Dm6     | E7b13  |
| Am7       | Dm7  |
